/-!
# Rudvalis level-0 part 4 subcertificates

This group certifies part-4 batch indices 1 through 14.
The imported batch certificates discharge all algebraic and permutation branches.
These proofs use the fixed ATLAS witnesses documented in `OrderLevel0Data`.
Generated by `OrderCertificate/GenerateLevel0Part4Groups.py` and compressed by
`OrderCertificate/GenerateLevel0Part4Group0Compression.py`; all finite
equalities are checked by Lean's kernel. Word normalization uses the proved
orders 2 and 4, through `OrderLevel0Reduction`.
-/

namespace Rudvalis.OrderCertificate.ForwardReduction.Part4Certificates
set_option maxRecDepth 30000
set_option Elab.async false

public theorem group0 (b : Fin 14) :
